              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Overlooking alpha-gal and other allergies</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
